    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 成为网红老师，让我赚到人生的一桶金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 副业收入是主业的5倍 | 只要你有钱，你在职场里的生态位就会完全不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">17:18</a> 被老板PUA的核心原因是你的经济实力不够强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a>网红老师的阶段一：巨大的讲课量，拼个人能力和个人体力，练就在行业内的“一招鲜”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">23:21</a> 网红老师的阶段二：凭业务能力向外社交，保持竞争的活性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 网红老师的阶段三：运用杠杆，走差异化路线，一定要擅长自我营销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a>《一站到底》节目冠军的经验帖：综艺的报名方式、综艺的红利、综艺的名人效应</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpeg5JYpGkQ40fXn65zUCdw3Upe0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 上镜胖10斤？数值柠檬减肥法，1天掉1斤，屡试不爽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2232">37:12</a> 揭秘综艺节目录制全程和“恶意剪辑”</span></p><span></span><p><span>*胜子本人微信</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>胜子VX：Shengzi2300,</span></strong><span>添加请备注[播客+职业+城市]，看本期播客中提到的朋友圈哦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvxApZMgubbP-eYvw3hX_Sr4YPO9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>谢胜子小助手VX：Pillyxie,</span></strong><span>可领取《胜子的108篇干货文章》，添加请备注[播客+职业+城市]</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>*关注胜子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：胜子商业笔记/谢胜子工作室/谢胜子高能专场/谢胜子</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2258207595" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2258207595"><span>谢胜子</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/592997515e87e716a3746f75?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6053640c00000000010032ff&amp;apptime=1675278254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/592997515e87e716a