  <item>
    <title>Vol.8 做个会生活的女人没那么难，关于睡眠、饮食、运动的私人心得</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c213b6e8176c3ff8cfdd13</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c213b6e8176c3ff8cfdd13</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Jul 2023 06:50:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a>现代人的压力和辛苦都是因为欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a>睡眠、运动、饮食，这三者中最重要的一定是睡眠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 正A和负A都非常消耗你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">8:40</a> 高质量睡眠的技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a>控制体重不要牺牲你的效率、思维清晰度和睡眠质量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a>女人就是感受型动物：香薰、身体乳、身体精油、泡澡，漂亮的睡衣、舒服的床上用品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a>只要你不会做饭，你永远都无法控制你的体重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>是工作上的强者但是生活的智障，减损魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a>最好的招待一定是家宴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 戒冰、戒饮料、戒咖啡，多喝热水、多泡茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 尝试医美，能承受的极限是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>拿着咖啡去见客户的气场只是一种白领气场，真正的气场要像安迪一样「喝水」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2681">44:41</a> 运动具备社交属性，练一个长期深耕的运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a>通过打高尔夫打网球，锻炼心性、总结哲学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2933">48:53</a>彻底从小女生走过来了，瘦几斤真的无所谓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a>人要不断追求优秀，只有真正的优秀才能让你松弛</span></p><span></span><p><span>*胜子本人微信</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>胜子VX：Shengzi2300,</span></strong><span>添加请备注[播客+职业+城市]，看本期播客中提到的朋友圈哦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>谢胜子小助手VX：Pillyxie,</span></strong><span>添加请备注[播客+职业+城市]</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsARW-c3q_7QsE0B